{"asset_key":"mn2/herohub_story_10412011","episode":"mn2","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10412011","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1041201101:1":{"text":"브라이언 님, 계속 궁금했는데, 왜 항상 안대를 하고 있어요?","source_cn":"布莱恩先生，我一直很好奇，你为什么总是戴着眼罩呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3CBC38AB0E32606D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041201102:1":{"text":"설마... 안대를 차면 바람의 언어의 능력을 더 잘 훈련할 수 있나요?","source_cn":"难道说……这样可以更好地锻炼风语能力？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8B260442831F2D1B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:5:1041201102":{"text":"설마... 안대를 차면 바람의 언어의 능력을 더 잘 훈련할 수 있나요?","source_cn":"难道说……这样可以更好地锻炼风语能力？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8B260442831F2D1B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041201103:1":{"text":"맞아요. 바람의 언어는 100% 청각에 의존하는 능력입니다. 시각은 집중력이 흐트러져 짐이 될 뿐이죠.","source_cn":"是的。风语之能全靠听力，视觉只会扰乱思绪，反而显得累赘。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x27106042D10F9986","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:7:1041201103":{"text":"맞아요. 바람의 언어는 100% 청각에 의존하는 능력입니다. 시각은 집중력이 흐트러져 짐이 될 뿐이죠.","source_cn":"是的。风语之能全靠听力，视觉只会扰乱思绪，反而显得累赘。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x27106042D10F9986","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041201104:1":{"text":"저 말고는 그렇게 생각하는 사람이 없으니, 놀라시는 것도 당연합니다.","source_cn":"除我之外，或许没人会这样想，您会感到吃惊也是理所应当。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4897E16C4AEC3D53","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041201105:1":{"text":"전 재능이 뛰어난 사람이 아니라 다른 사람과의 격차를 줄이려면 더 많은 노력을 기울여야 하죠.","source_cn":"我并非极富天赋之人，无法与他人相较，自然应该付出更多努...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB1C0F5EA9B8F226B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:10:1041201105":{"text":"전 재능이 뛰어난 사람이 아니라 다른 사람과의 격차를 줄이려면 더 많은 노력을 기울여야 하죠.","source_cn":"我并非极富天赋之人，无法与他人相较，自然应该付出更多努力，才能勉强弥补一二。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB1C0F5EA9B8F226B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041201106:1":{"text":"눈으로 보는 게 진실이 아닐 때도 있어서요.","source_cn":"眼见不一定为实。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x78956917F2A42332","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041201107:1":{"text":"짐승이 사람을 공격한다면 그 장면을 눈으로 본 사람들은 당연히 짐승의 잘못이라고 여기겠죠.","source_cn":"若是一只野兽伤了人，众人以眼观看，自然觉得是野兽的错。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1EBEA8107163E711","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1041201108:1":{"text":"하지만 짐승도 생각이란 게 있답니다. 그 사람이 먼저 도발한 게 아닌 이상, 왜 사람을 공격하겠어요?","source_cn":"但野兽亦有灵性。若非外物挑衅，它怎会主动伤人？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x88E32F1EFF5C5873","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1041201109:1":{"text":"우리의 눈은 진실을 가려내지 못합니다. 따라서 방랑자인 전 제가 귀로 들은 소리와 감정을 더 믿죠.","source_cn":"可见，真实并非双眼可见。作为一名风语者，我更相信自己听...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8A9DE7B6C8E2E8FE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:15:1041201109":{"text":"우리의 눈은 진실을 가려내지 못합니다. 따라서 방랑자인 전 제가 귀로 들은 소리와 감정을 더 믿죠.","source_cn":"可见，真实并非双眼可见。作为一名风语者，我更相信自己听到的声音与情绪。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8A9DE7B6C8E2E8FE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1041201110:1":{"text":"말투, 속도, 심지어 호흡까지... 사람들은 아주 디테일한 부분에서 많은 감정을 드러내죠.","source_cn":"语气、语速，甚至是呼吸，越微小的细节，越能透露出一个人...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8D85A6AD08915108","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1041201111:1":{"text":"...특히 자신이 숨기고자 하는 비밀일수록 더 많이 드러나고요.","source_cn":"……尤其是那些众人试图隐藏的秘密。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x77745D8AA883F470","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1041201112:0":{"text":"그렇죠? 로잔 님.","source_cn":"对么，洛桑大人？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAF46E0B96ECF6A30","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1041201113:0":{"text":"엇! 언제 날 발견한 거지?!","source_cn":"——哇啊！你什么时候发现我的？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF809F28B13E7A60C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1041201114:1":{"text":"몰래 뒤로 와서 놀라게 하려고 했을 때부터요.","source_cn":"从您悄悄绕到后面，准备吓人的时候。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x951D66CB8E3F8A48","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1041201115:1":{"text":"...재미없어. 넌 귀가 너무 예민해서 번번이 실패한다니까.","source_cn":"……真无聊，你耳朵太尖了，没有一次成功的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x18826CB3784AB798","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1041201116:1":{"text":"다음번엔 꼭 성공할 거야!","source_cn":"算了，等下次！下次我一定要让你大吃一惊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC330839EF9CFF532","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1041201117:1":{"text":"귀 쫑긋 세우고 기다리겠습니다.","source_cn":"我“竖耳”以待。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF58B8BDFBB161752","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:15:0:1":{"text":"감정도 들려?","source_cn":"情绪也能听到？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x5D7A85F7009DD19A","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"감정도 들려?","female":"감정도 들려?","variant_male_record_index":"60918","variant_female_record_index":"60919","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:10:0:1":{"text":"안대를 착용하는 또 다른 이유가 있어?","source_cn":"还有其他戴眼罩的理由吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x9FCB15AF53FED57B","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"안대를 착용하는 또 다른 이유가 있어?","female":"안대를 착용하는 또 다른 이유가 있어?","variant_male_record_index":"60916","variant_female_record_index":"60917","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:7:0:1":{"text":"그런 이야기는 처음 듣는데...","source_cn":"我还是第一次听到这种说法……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x6D0B1F2740C5B181","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"그런 이야기는 처음 듣는데...","female":"그런 이야기는 처음 듣는데...","variant_male_record_index":"60912","variant_female_record_index":"60913","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:7:1:2":{"text":"조금 거추장스럽네...","source_cn":"真是奢侈的累赘呢","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x0BF702F260700E74","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"조금 거추장스럽네...","female":"조금 거추장스럽네...","variant_male_record_index":"60914","variant_female_record_index":"60915","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:5:0:1":{"text":"시야를 차단하려고?","source_cn":"为了阻绝视觉？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xC4B36C23365300DB","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"시야를 차단하려고?","female":"시야를 차단하려고?","variant_male_record_index":"60908","variant_female_record_index":"60909","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:5:1:2":{"text":"청각에 더욱 집중하려고?","source_cn":"为了集中注意在听觉上？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x161736D9FE49D006","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"청각에 더욱 집중하려고?","female":"청각에 더욱 집중하려고?","variant_male_record_index":"60910","variant_female_record_index":"60911","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:布莱恩":{"text":"브라이언","source":"布莱恩","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:洛桑":{"text":"로잔","source":"洛桑","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":28,"localized_text_count":27,"speaker_count":3}}